# =============================================================================
# 96-installer-pool-uefi.list.binary - GRUB for UEFI installs (ISO pool)
# =============================================================================
# What: grub-efi (the package Debian's bootloader-config installs on UEFI
#       machines) with its signed variants, so Secure Boot works.
# Why:  offline UEFI installs from the ISO; see 95-installer-pool-bios.list.binary.
# Format rules: see 10-base.list.chroot.
# =============================================================================

grub-efi
grub-efi-amd64
grub-efi-amd64-signed
shim-signed
